   316	`x=s(t)²` (`\deg s=4`) or `x=u(t)^4` (`\deg u=2`) holds here. It does not.
   317	
   318	**Lemma NO-FOLD (PROVED-HERE).** *On the `(8,4)` row in normal form `(1.5)`, `P` is not a
   319	perfect square in `C[t]`. A fortiori `P ≠ u^4`.*
