   738	### 5.5 Campaign consequence
   739	
   740	`OPEN[PI1S4-(8,4)-FIXED-TUPLE]` (ROW-SWEEP §6; coordinator integration §2) is **resolved
   741	NO**, at the scope of Theorem ROW-KILL. Combined with TORUS-CHECK's `(6,4)` kill, the
   742	coordinator's "one target-isomorphism class" residual core is closed in both of its
   743	presentations, and the `N=4` residual cage reduces to the two AM-numerical rows `(8,6)`
   744	and `(9,6)`, whose nodal attainment is itself unproved. If Theorem ROW-NF or Theorem
   745	ROW-KILL is later downgraded, Theorem B falls with it and the live residual becomes
   746	`OPEN[TRIPLE-PLANE-BRANCH-DEGREE-8-ROW-84]` together with
   747	`OPEN[PI1S4-(8,4)-INF-TRIVIAL]`; Theorems A, OCT-TRIPLE, OCT-SYZYGY and the lemmas of
   748	§§1–3 are unaffected either way.
