   524	### 5.3 The product of a geometric basis
   525	
   526	For a geometric basis `(g_1,…,g_6)` of `π₁(ℓ ∖ (ℓ∩D_j))` on a fibre line
   527	`ℓ = {x=x_*}`, the ordered product `g_6g_5g_4g_3g_2g_1` is the class of a large circle,
