+Let (d=\deg \bar D), let (r_1) be the number of nodes, and put
+(T:=\sum_{k_p\geq2}k_p).  The exact genus budget is
+
+\[
+  \delta_{\rm aff}=\sum_p k_p=r_1+T,\qquad
+  \delta_\infty+\delta_{\rm aff}=\frac{(d-1)(d-2)}2.                 \tag{1.1}
+\]
