+| sign (S_5/A_5) | 2 | (2) | double cover; loses the (A_5) layer |
+| six Sylow-5 subgroups | 6 | (2^3) | classical sextic resolvent, faithful |
+| two-element subsets | 10 | (1^4 2^3) | faithful degree-ten resolvent |
