+Notation is deliberately separated.  The curve-normalization parameter is (t);
+the unique normalization place at infinity is (Q_\infty); a physical affine
+double point is (p); (s_l) is a dicritical-to-normalization cover degree; and
+the five letters are sheets of the Keller covering.  The genus (g_L) appearing
