+ (\mu,\operatorname{corr},s)_A=(2,1,1),\ (W_A,a_A)=(2,3),\qquad
+ (\mu,\operatorname{corr},s)_B=(1,0,1),\ (W_B,a_B)=(1,4),
+\]
+
+with two components and one correction parameter of (K=1), hence (M=3) and one
