   100	## 2. The (S_5) monodromy problem and the failed (S_4) resolvent transfer
   101	
   102	The reviewed monodromy is a necessary representation
   103	
   104	\[
   105	 \rho:\pi_1(\mathbb C^2-D)\twoheadrightarrow S_5,\qquad
   106	 \rho(\text{meridian})\sim(2,1,1,1).                              \tag{2.1}
   107	\]
