+Landesman--Vakil--Wood supply cover structure, not a classification of prescribed
+plane branch divisors.  Gonzalez-Meneses was consulted only as auxiliary braid-
+group background; the plane-curve Zariski--van Kampen comparisons in §5 are
+derived there rather than attributed to that source.  No Chisini theorem is
+consumed in a kill step.

