+| P3a | $(\mu,\operatorname{corr},s)=(2,0,1)$ over $D$; one $(1,0,1)$ over each of two other components | $(2,3),(1,4),(1,4)$, $m=3$ |
+| P3b | $(2,0,1)$ over $D$; both $(1,0,1)$'s over one other component | $(2,3),(2,3)$, $m=2$ |
